From: Suren Baghdasaryan <surenb@google.com>
Subject: selftests/proc: add verbose more for tests to facilitate debugging
Date: Tue, 24 Jun 2025 12:33:57 -0700

Add verbose mode to the proc tests to print debugging information.  Usage:
proc-pid-vm -v

Link: https://lkml.kernel.org/r/20250624193359.3865351-6-surenb@google.com
Signed-off-by: Suren Baghdasaryan <surenb@google.com>
